cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite the article and this repository."
title: "Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma in China, 1990-2023: a Global Burden of Disease 2023 analysis - data and code"
abstract: >-
  GBD 2023 analysis of cutaneous squamous-cell-carcinoma burden in China
  (1990-2023): Newey-West autocorrelation-robust trend testing, Das Gupta
  decomposition of case growth into population growth, population ageing and
  epidemiological change, age-sex patterns, mortality-to-incidence comparison
  and a GBD 2021 vs 2023 cross-cycle sensitivity comparison. Includes the
  machine-readable result tables, the R/Python pipeline, the archived GBD
  download parameters and the final manuscript figures.
